{{/each}}

Schema:
{
  "nfrs": [
    {
      "category":          "performance" | "reliability" | "security" | "usability"
                            | "maintainability" | "portability" | "observability" | "compliance",
      "statement":         string,
      "measurableTarget":  string,
      "verificationMethod": string   // optional — how it will be checked
    }
  ]
}

Constraints:
- Do NOT include "id" — IDs are assigned by the tool (NFR-NNN).
- "measurableTarget" MUST be measurable (e.g., "P95 latency < 200ms at 1000 RPS",
  "RTO 15m / RPO 5m", "no critical CVEs older than 30 days"). Avoid vague words.
- Cover at least: performance, reliability, security, observability where applicable.

Return JSON only.
